This folder contains a program that does the following:

- Contains a ingestor that accepts a list and a chosen sorting algorithm
- Sends the list to the right thread to perform the chosen sort
- The thread sends the results to an consumer which writes it to a database

In total it will contain 4 threads:
1 ingestor, 3 sorters and 1 consumer

Once this is implemented, I will extend this to another interesting design where
there are 3 workers performing operations on the same ingested data and the result
of those operations are aggregated by a consumer that writes it to file. 